  data: {
    LLM: "1. The first player plays any number of cards face-down and declares they are 'Aces'.\n2. The next player must play/declare '2s', then '3s', and so on up to 'Kings', then back to 'Aces'.\n3. You can play cards that ARE NOT the declared rank, but you must LIE and say they are.",
    Player: "1. The first player plays any number of cards face-down and declares they are 'Aces'.\n2. The next player must play/declare '2s', then '3s', and so on up to 'Kings', then back to 'Aces'.\n3. You can play cards that ARE NOT the declared rank, but you must LIE and say they are.",
    objective: 'Be the first player to get rid of all your cards by playing them face-down to the center pile and declaring their rank in sequence (Aces through Kings); you may bluff, but if challenged and caught you take the pile.',
    gameplay: "1. The first player plays any number of cards face-down and declares they are 'Aces'.\n2. The next player must play/declare '2s', then '3s', and so on up to 'Kings', then back to 'Aces'.\n3. You can play cards that ARE NOT the declared rank, but you must LIE and say they are.",
    keyRules: [
      "Entire deck dealt evenly to all players. Play face-down and declare rank in sequence (Aces, 2s, up to Kings, then Aces). You may bluff. Any player may call 'Fool!' to challenge; if wrong they take the pile, if right the declarer takes the pile. First to empty hand wins.",
